      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BATTLE SPEED (2) was strongly fancied latest and proved too good with a 5.5 lengths win at Bulli in a handy 19.15. Fair draw can see a good run and has a good record over this journey. Winner at his latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Expected to be right there at the finish again. CLYBURN (5) has a strong record this track and trip with two wins and two placings from six starts. Comes off a (19.75) win last time, scoring by 2.75 lengths in a Grade 5 over 350m at this track. Can feature with the right run. MOTOR CITY CHIEF (8) filled a minor placing last start at Gunnedah behind Little Miss Ando (19.93) in a Grade 5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. The form from his last run stacks up well. Expected to feature. LUMEAH STORM (7) finished in the placings last start and deserves some thought.",
